        {
          "_key": "c01914c4-930",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This style is usually better to instant expo instead of doing a lvl 3 creep route into an expo like you would do with archmage.  After starting expo, use footies to scout opponent. Play defense until towers are up. You can look to be aggressive vs wisp + buildings that are not complete, but try to avoid all-in large fights until tier 2.  He will likely push you at tier 2 after grabbing naga,panda, or tinker (if he went dh), or he will tier 2 push with hunts and ancient protectors if he went potm or kotg. Use towers, shop, and footies with defend to  hold this push while you wait for hawk production. (3 aviaries)."
        }
      ],
